  "rationale": "The batch exposes two recurring contexts where the current grammar underpredicts useful continuations: proper names after an opening comma or after “with”, and nouns after descriptive adjectives, including “sunny day”. The proposed suffix rules express those reusable patterns without fixing a particular name or adjective. They add evidence for several names and common nouns rather than making alternatives impossible. Other names may still be appropriate after these contexts, and adjectives can precede non-nouns, so the added evidence is deliberately not exclusive. The previous teacher candidate improved current and replay loss; this proposal targets the remaining structural underprediction, but has not passed the replay gate.",
